  "description": "Spacious & Bright 2-Bedroom Apartment Available 1 year Let\n\nA spacious and bright two-bedroom apartment is available to rent.\n\nThe apartment will be rented as a whole, giving the tenant exclusive use of the entire property. It is well-maintained, fully equipped, and offers a comfortable and welcoming living space.\n\nThe apartment features:\n\n🛏️ 2 spacious double bedrooms\n\n🛋️ Large, bright living room\n\n🍳 Kitchen\n\n🚿 Modern bathroom\n\n🔥 Heating system throughout\n\n💧 Hot water supplied by an electric boiler\n\n🛗 Lift access\n\n📹 Security cameras in the building\n\nThe apartment is ideally located next to Memorial Park and Phoenix Park, perfect for walks, running, or relaxing outdoors. It is also close to Gyms, as well as plenty of coffee shops, supermarkets, and other local amenities, making everyday life very convenient.\n\nThe apartment is being offered fully furnished and as an entire property, making it a great option for a family, friends, or someone looking for a comfortable two-bedroom home.\n\nThe home is tidy, comfortable, and well-kept, and I’m looking for respectful tenants who will take good care of the apartment during the rental period.",
